        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy Character + Clothing (OOTD) Flat Lay to Studio Photoshoot\n\nUpload an image of your character and a flatlay image of your clothing items. Generate 4 fashion editorial photographs of your character in the outfit. Select which image to upscale and add back details. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/templates-fashion_shoot_vton.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
        },
        "ui_properties": {
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": -440
          },
          "width": 600
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "1",
        "type": "comfy.LoadImage",
        "data": {
          "image": "subject.png"
        },
        "ui_properties": {
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "width": 280,
          "title": "Load Subject Image"
        },
        "dynamic_properties": {},
        "dynamic_outputs": {}
      },
      {
        "id": "5",
        "type": "comfy.PrimitiveStringMultiline",
        "data": {
          "value": "A 2x2 (2 rows, 2 cols) grid of high fashion photoshoot images of the model wearing the outfit from image 2, each grid image should show the a full body shot of the subject in slightly different poses. Ensure that all outfit clothes/accessories are present in each grid image.\n\nDO NOT generate the grid with any visible borders or gutters.\n\nThe setting is a studio environment with a white studio background. Ensure that each grid image has the same lighting conditions. \n\nThe image is shot on fuji velvia film on a 55mm prime lens, the light is concentrated on the subject."
        },
        "ui_properties": {
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 330
          },
          "width": 280,
          "title": "Prompt"
        },
        "dynamic_properties": {},
        "dynamic_outputs": {}
      },
